As far as I know, DIGITAL UNIX doesn't have a driver to support
the Matrox cards.  It appears that your running in generic VGA
mode, which will give you the 640/480 res. w/ 16 colors.

You can verify this by entering:

	#sizer -gt

The result of this command will most likely be "GENERIC".

